      {
        "title": "The Daily: Bitcoin records highest monthly close, Coinbase re-enters top 10 public treasury companies with 2,509 BTC buy, and more",
        "text": "\n            <p>The following article is adapted from The Block\u2019s newsletter, The Daily, which comes out on weekday afternoons.</p>\n        ",
